# A walker shouts at the crew van (game/peds.ts, docs/mechanics/driving.md; data/vehicles.json
# reactions). On Duboce's south side, where the sidewalk's walking line runs by the curb, a walker heads
# west; the van comes up behind them in the kerb lane (between the freeway's columns and the curb), at
# 6 m/s when it reaches them, and stops short of the streetlight that stands in the lane in the squeezed
# city. From behind they do not see it coming; it comes within 1.5 m of them (reactions.nearMiss) at
# speed: a near miss, and they shout (pedShout near, a line from reactions.pedShouts), then step aside
# late. Nothing scores; once per shoutCooldown.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 ped at 98 -20 270
cmd 1 van summon 104 -15.85 270
cmd 2 vehicle enter crew_van
bot drive 104,-15.85 95.5,-15.85 from 40 speed 8 stop
run 900
expect event vehicleEnter within 2..3
expect no event pedStep within 0..176
expect event pedShout{near=true} within 172..182
expect event pedShout count == 1
expect no event nearMiss
expect no event vanBump
expect no event pedHit
